// alap → jor → gat → antara → taans → jhala.
// The raga: S r G M P d N — aroha S r G M P d N Ṡ, avaroha Ṡ N d P M G r S; vadi d, samvadi r;
// pakad S G M d d P, M G r r S; andolan (a slow swing below the note) on r, d.
// Shrutis — every swara in just intonation (cents from 12-TET): S +0, r -9.8, G -13.7, M -2, P +2, d -7.8, N -11.7.
// Alap in free time over the tanpura; jor (a pulse, chikari between); gat and antara in teentaal (X 2 0 3) with the tabla;
// taans answered by the bansuri, a tihai — three times the phrase, its last note on the sam: s₁ = C − e − 2(p + g); jhala.
// x is time in beats; n counts semitones from Sa (0 = the middle Sa, D3).
import { exp, filter, floor, hz as hz12, mod, reverb } from '../src/engine.js'
